  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Hydrogen 2 South Africa-Namibia business cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An overall Dutch-South African and/or Namibian Business Collaboration Plan, including three to five Business Collaboration Agreements, will be formalised during the World Hydrogen Summit end of May 2025 in Rotterdam.These Collaboration Agreements match South African and/or Namibian needs for Dutch Solutions and are aimed at the development of partnerships, including a high level business plan and a high-level programme plan.</narrative>
  </description>
